<title>JAPAN: BOJ injects 200 bln yen into money market-traders.</title>
<headline>BOJ injects 200 bln yen into money market-traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) injected a net 200 billion yen into the money market on Thursday, money traders said.</p>
<p>The money market had a projected fund surplus of 100 billion yen coming into the day.</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-5473-3748</p>
